{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0218-s001", "text": "Du kan få ålderspension när du uppnår pensionsåldern.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0218-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.274261474609375, "generation_seconds": 13.033778683049604, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0218-s002", "text": "Åldersgränsen beror på när du är född.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0218-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.276824951171875, "generation_seconds": 11.559748745989054, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:44:26.998363+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0218-s003", "text": "Om du till exempel är född 1964, är din pensionsålder 65 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0218-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.23486328125, "generation_seconds": 22.45376348681748, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:45:00.597078+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0219-s001", "text": "Pensioner betalas ut av arbetspensionsanstalter och F P A.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0219-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.3214111328125, "generation_seconds": 20.487357538891956, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0219-s002", "text": "Arbetspensionsanstalterna betalar ut arbetspension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0219-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.50152587890625, "generation_seconds": 17.41577661712654, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:45:34.185390+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0219-s003", "text": "Den grundar sig på lönen och andra arbetsinkomster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0219-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.3575439453125, "generation_seconds": 13.450447109993547, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:46:07.747845+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0219-s004", "text": "Om arbetspensionen är liten, kan du också få pension från F P A.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0219-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.30780029296875, "generation_seconds": 19.27415765216574, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0220-s001", "text": "Om du vill kan du också arbeta när du är pensionerad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0220-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.382965087890625, "generation_seconds": 20.139868292957544, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:46:37.749198+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0220-s002", "text": "Om du får ålderspension påverkar din arbetsinkomst inte pensionens storlek.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0220-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.308868408203125, "generation_seconds": 22.371308729983866, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:47:11.383160+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0220-s003", "text": "Då tjänar du in ny pension, som betalas ut till dig när du uppnått den högsta pensionsåldern.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0220-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.278533935546875, "generation_seconds": 29.219361815135926, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:47:45.030340+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0220-s004", "text": "Den högsta pensionsåldern är den ålder då du inte längre tjänar in ny pension även om du fortsätter arbeta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0220-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.290435791015625, "generation_seconds": 33.601184924831614, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:48:18.527449+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T07:48:52.102057+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0220-s005", "text": "Du kan kontrollera dina lägsta och högsta ålderspensionsålder till exempel med Pensionsskyddscentralens (Eläketurvakeskus) eller arbetspensionsanstaltens räknare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0220-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.931972789115646, "peak": 0.448944091796875, "generation_seconds": 55.59743861597963, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:49:25.686830+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0221-s001", "text": "Du måste själv ansöka om pension hos din arbetspensionsanstalt, eftersom utbetalningen inte börjar automatiskt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0221-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.32659912109375, "generation_seconds": 36.94479029485956, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:49:59.283381+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0222-s001", "text": "I Finland betalas skatt på pensionerna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0222-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.33966064453125, "generation_seconds": 11.834147518035024, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0223-s001", "text": "När du arbetar, betalas arbetspensionsavgifter från din lön.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0223-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.460296630859375, "generation_seconds": 19.72894820291549, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:50:32.861915+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0223-s002", "text": "Ju högre lön eller arbetsinkomst som företagare du får och ju längre du arbetar, desto större blir din arbetspension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0223-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.330596923828125, "generation_seconds": 29.878458028892055, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:51:06.446277+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0224-s001", "text": "Arbetspensionsförsäkringsbolag, pensionskassor och -stiftelser har hand om arbetspensionsförsäkringarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0224-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.343109130859375, "generation_seconds": 33.12899106787518, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:51:40.036983+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0224-s002", "text": "Pensionsskyddscentralen sköter centraliserat frågor som rör pensionsskyddet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0224-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.28521728515625, "generation_seconds": 28.523434908129275, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:52:13.620620+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0225-s001", "text": "Du ska själv följa upp i ditt arbetspensionsutdrag att alla förvärvsinkomster som du haft finns med.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0225-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.53662109375, "generation_seconds": 35.8355199159123, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:52:47.209637+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0225-s002", "text": "Om uppgifterna är fel, kontakta din pensionsanstalt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0225-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.330535888671875, "generation_seconds": 14.242855141172186, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:53:20.793296+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0226-s001", "text": "Du kan ansöka om folkpension om du inte har någon arbetspension eller om din arbetspension är väldigt liten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0226-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.423370361328125, "generation_seconds": 28.035331335151568, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:53:54.382431+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0226-s002", "text": "Folkpensionens belopp beror på hur länge du har bott eller arbetat i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0226-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.38916015625, "generation_seconds": 23.57449798984453, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:54:28.003965+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0226-s003", "text": "Dina familjeförhållanden och andra kontinuerliga pensionsinkomster påverkar också folkpensionens belopp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0226-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.125442176870749, "peak": 0.28668212890625, "generation_seconds": 32.24605173408054, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0226-s004", "text": "F P A sköter folkpensionerna och garantipensionerna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0226-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.301300048828125, "generation_seconds": 16.609043957898393, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:54:58.007256+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T07:55:31.636886+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0227-s001", "text": "Du kan söka folkpension och garantipension om du omfattas av Finländska socialskyddet och när du har bott i Finland minst tre år efter att du fyllde 16 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0227-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.79265306122449, "peak": 0.336517333984375, "generation_seconds": 41.236013400834054, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:56:05.139745+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0227-s002", "text": "Också den tid som du har varit bosatt i något annat E U- eller E E S-land kan delvis beaktas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0227-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.70748299319728, "peak": 0.293243408203125, "generation_seconds": 27.437035706127062, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0228-s001", "text": "Garantipensionen tryggar ett existensminimum för pensionärer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0228-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.313568115234375, "generation_seconds": 17.565641968045384, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:56:38.723666+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0228-s002", "text": "Garantipensionens belopp är mellanskillnaden mellan de övriga pensionerna som du får och garantipensionens fulla belopp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0228-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.277557373046875, "generation_seconds": 32.20747954095714, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:57:12.312363+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0228-s003", "text": "Om det sammanlagda beloppet från dina övriga pensioner överskrider garantipensionens fulla belopp kan du inte få garantipension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0228-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.00625850340136, "peak": 0.287078857421875, "generation_seconds": 34.691708899103105, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:57:45.902404+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T07:58:19.484284+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0229-s001", "text": "Pensionsförsäkringen för företagare, FöPL, tryggar din försörjning om du börjar få sjukpension eller ålderspension och företagsverksamheten upphör.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0229-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.956734693877552, "peak": 0.284454345703125, "generation_seconds": 36.08716464298777, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0229-s002", "text": "Anhöriga kan få familjepension efter att företagaren avlider.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0229-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.449554443359375, "generation_seconds": 16.980574869085103, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T07:58:53.068271+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T07:59:26.684196+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0229-s003", "text": "Pensionsförsäkringen för företagare, FöPL, påverkar förutom arbetspensionen också storleken på F P A:s stöd, till exempel sjukdagpenningen, arbetslöshetsförmånen eller föräldradagpenningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0229-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 17.205986394557822, "peak": 0.36614990234375, "generation_seconds": 61.7332927910611, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:00:00.245116+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0230-s001", "text": "Om din arbetspension är liten kan du dessutom få folkpension eller garantipension från F P A.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0230-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.29449462890625, "generation_seconds": 31.303775617154315, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:00:33.838759+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0230-s002", "text": "Du får mer information om pensionsärenden hos F P A eller arbetspensionsanstalten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0230-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.356597900390625, "generation_seconds": 30.00795349595137, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:01:07.420081+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T08:01:41.005716+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0231-s001", "text": "Om du har arbetat i andra länder som Finland inte har ett socialskyddsavtal med, måste du själv ta reda på om du har rätt att få pension från dessa länder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0231-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.514013605442177, "peak": 0.3538818359375, "generation_seconds": 53.70288975699805, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:02:14.596233+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0231-s002", "text": "Om du kan få pension, måste du själv ansöka om den.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0231-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.310577392578125, "generation_seconds": 19.58052932913415, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:02:44.597991+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0232-s001", "text": "Du ska alltid meddela F P A om varaktig flytt utomlands eller vistelse utomlands som varar över tre månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0232-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.369384765625, "generation_seconds": 36.29189734579995, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:03:18.181603+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0233-s001", "text": "Om du vistas utomlands tillfälligt, det vill säga under ett år, betalar F P A vanligtvis din pension som vanligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0233-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.28399658203125, "generation_seconds": 39.04227300500497, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:03:51.765045+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0233-s002", "text": "Om du flyttar utomlands för över ett år, kan du vanligtvis inte få F P A:s ålderspension eller invalidpension från Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0233-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.493877551020407, "peak": 0.29669189453125, "generation_seconds": 35.396373508963734, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:04:25.366785+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0233-s003", "text": "F P A betalar inte heller garantipension till utlandet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0233-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.329833984375, "generation_seconds": 21.410913249012083, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:04:58.945289+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0234-s001", "text": "I vissa fall kan F P A emellertid betala pension till sådana länder med vilka Finland har ett socialskyddsavtal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0234-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.031020408163265, "peak": 0.263916015625, "generation_seconds": 39.008712260983884, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:05:32.596124+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0234-s002", "text": "Exempel på dessa länder är USA, Kanada, Israel, Chile och Australien.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0234-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.25994873046875, "generation_seconds": 23.525459707016125, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:06:06.113683+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s001", "text": "Om du har fyllt 61 eller 62 år kan du få partiell pension redan före din lägsta ålderspensionsålder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.493877551020407, "peak": 0.285675048828125, "generation_seconds": 34.26700272690505, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:06:39.797438+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s002", "text": "Åldersgränsen för pension beror på vilket år du är född.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.2578125, "generation_seconds": 17.620183432940394, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s003", "text": "Detta kallas partiell förtida ålderspension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.3450927734375, "generation_seconds": 14.333024215884507, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:07:13.298791+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T08:07:46.875163+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s004", "text": "Du kan själv välja om du vill ta ut 25 procent eller 50 procent av beloppet på din månatliga arbetspension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.075918367346938, "peak": 0.308868408203125, "generation_seconds": 36.50084455194883, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:08:20.457583+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s005", "text": "Om du vill kan du samtidigt fortsätta arbeta heltid eller komma överens om en kortare arbetstid med arbetsgivaren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.412750244140625, "generation_seconds": 38.780217993073165, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s006", "text": "Du kan också sluta arbeta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.716734693877551, "peak": 0.358367919921875, "generation_seconds": 10.760837206151336, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:08:54.044342+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s007", "text": "Du bör observera att den partiella förtida ålderspensionen permanent minskar beloppet på den slutliga ålderspensionen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s007.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.100680272108843, "peak": 0.32958984375, "generation_seconds": 29.656912931008264, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:09:27.704112+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0235-s008", "text": "Du kan fråga mer av din pensionsanstalt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0235-s008.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.2808837890625, "generation_seconds": 14.956133036874235, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:10:01.278292+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0236-s001", "text": "Om du är sjuk under en lång tid får du vanligtvis först sjukdagpenning i ungefär ett år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0236-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.254791259765625, "generation_seconds": 30.995444112922996, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:10:34.838151+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T08:11:04.840054+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0236-s002", "text": "Om du inte kan återgå till arbetet på grund av sjukdom eller skada, kan du ansöka om sjukpension (työkyvyttömyyseläke) eller rehabiliteringsstöd (kuntoutustuki).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0236-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.280272108843537, "peak": 0.504364013671875, "generation_seconds": 60.82422494608909, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:11:38.455268+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
2026-11-03T08:12:11.992418+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0237-s001", "text": "Den partiella sjukpensionen (osatyökyvyttömyyseläke) tryggar din försörjning om din arbetsförmåga är nedsatt, men du ändå kan arbeta på deltid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0237-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.329795918367347, "peak": 0.3433837890625, "generation_seconds": 51.28967873821966, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0237-s002", "text": "Den partiella sjukpensionen är hälften av sjukpensionen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0237-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.2818603515625, "generation_seconds": 17.77710220706649, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:12:45.579510+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0238-s001", "text": "Om du förvärvsarbetar eller bedriver företagsverksamhet samtidigt som du får sjukpension ska du fråga F P A eller din arbetspensionsanstalt hur mycket du får tjäna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0238-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.628571428571428, "peak": 0.329071044921875, "generation_seconds": 41.929151671007276, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:13:19.280945+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0238-s002", "text": "Om du har en tillräckligt hög inkomst från arbetet per månad kan du låta din pension vila.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0238-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.32342529296875, "generation_seconds": 20.689086409984156, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:13:52.755640+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0238-s003", "text": "Detta innebär att du håller en paus i lyftandet av pensionen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0238-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.3095703125, "generation_seconds": 11.757848992012441, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0238-s004", "text": "Pausen kan vara minst tre månader och högst två år lång.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0238-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.30950927734375, "generation_seconds": 12.375186695018783, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0238-s005", "text": "Under denna tid förlorar du inte rätten till sjukpension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0238-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.282867431640625, "generation_seconds": 11.32482749200426, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:14:26.338360+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0239-s001", "text": "Utöver pension kan F P A betala ut bostadsbidrag till pensionstagare med låga inkomster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0239-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.27386474609375, "generation_seconds": 17.508513843873516, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0240-s001", "text": "Till långtidssjuka eller handikappade kan F P A betala ut vårdbidrag för pensionstagare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0240-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.283355712890625, "generation_seconds": 14.48176971799694, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:14:59.926347+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0240-s002", "text": "Fråga mer på F P A.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0240-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.4380952380952383, "peak": 0.29986572265625, "generation_seconds": 5.566726933931932, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0241-s001", "text": "När du har pensionerats kan du få pensionärsrabatt till exempel på tåg-, buss- och flygresor i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0241-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.307525634765625, "generation_seconds": 20.597553401021287, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:15:33.514089+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0241-s002", "text": "De som fyllt 65 år får reserabatt genom att uppvisa sitt identitetsbevis.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0241-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.311248779296875, "generation_seconds": 18.71966210496612, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:16:07.165079+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0241-s003", "text": "En pensionär som inte har fyllt 65 år kan få rabatt genom att uppvisa sitt personbevis och sitt arbetspensionskort eller folkpensionärskort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0241-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.165714285714285, "peak": 0.328125, "generation_seconds": 37.75962450611405, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:16:40.682587+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0241-s004", "text": "Kontrollera villkoren för pensionärsrabatten på biljettkontoren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0241-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.37017822265625, "generation_seconds": 20.576583571964875, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:17:14.270376+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0242-s001", "text": "Du kan även få rabatt på exempelvis olika former av motion och kultur.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0242-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.300750732421875, "generation_seconds": 21.05805919901468, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:17:47.989520+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0243-s001", "text": "Finlands pensionssystem består av tre delar: arbetspension, folkpension och garantipension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0243-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.4661865234375, "generation_seconds": 30.36618004902266, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0243-s002", "text": "Ofta består en persons pension av flera olika typer av pensioner, till exempel arbetspension och partiell folkpension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0243-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.62213134765625, "generation_seconds": 26.926331290975213, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:18:21.483994+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0244-s001", "text": "Största delen av pensionerna är arbetspensioner.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0244-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.3594970703125, "generation_seconds": 13.495358449872583, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:18:51.485389+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0244-s002", "text": "Arbetspensionens belopp baserar sig på de pensionsförsäkringsavgifter som man betalat på sin lön.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0244-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.301605224609375, "generation_seconds": 23.65695094806142, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0244-s003", "text": "En del av försäkringsavgifterna betalas av arbetstagaren och en del av arbetsgivaren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0244-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.30926513671875, "generation_seconds": 22.461750129936263, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:19:25.088487+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0244-s004", "text": "Pensionens belopp påverkas av bland annat lönens nivå och antalet arbetsår.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0244-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.3485107421875, "generation_seconds": 15.235596752958372, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0244-s005", "text": "Arbetspensionen betalas av en arbetspensionsanstalt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0244-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.4957275390625, "generation_seconds": 12.864462689962238, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:19:58.648075+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0244-s006", "text": "Också företagare kan få arbetspension, men de måste betala sina pensionsförsäkringsavgifter själva.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0244-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.290802001953125, "generation_seconds": 25.146767360158265, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:20:32.234121+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0245-s001", "text": "Om en person inte längre kan arbeta på grund av en sjukdom eller skada, kan hen få invalidpension från en arbetspensionsanstalt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0245-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.354557823129252, "peak": 0.318817138671875, "generation_seconds": 37.309277983149514, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:21:05.892772+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0245-s002", "text": "Det kan man få redan före den officiella pensionsåldern.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0245-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.31866455078125, "generation_seconds": 17.29236296401359, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:21:39.457398+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0245-s003", "text": "Invalidpensionen kan vara full eller partiell.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0245-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.37432861328125, "generation_seconds": 16.963904212927446, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0245-s004", "text": "Partiell invalidpension innebär att personen arbetar deltid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0245-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.37359619140625, "generation_seconds": 20.64205820299685, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:22:12.999982+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0245-s005", "text": "Hens inkomster består då av dels en lön och dels en pension.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0245-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.232086181640625, "generation_seconds": 16.270406282041222, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:22:46.587464+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0246-s001", "text": "En person kan tjäna in pension i alla de länder där hen har bott och arbetat.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0246-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.360687255859375, "generation_seconds": 20.074780396185815, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0246-s002", "text": "I allmänhet tjänar man in pension genom att arbeta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0246-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.3238525390625, "generation_seconds": 15.311223529977724, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:23:20.276515+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0246-s003", "text": "I en del länder kan man ansöka om pension med samma blankett som man ansöker om pension i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0246-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.418243408203125, "generation_seconds": 25.34101724298671, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:23:53.754162+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0246-s004", "text": "En del länders pensioner söks å andra sidan direkt hos pensionsanstalterna i länderna i fråga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0246-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.29718017578125, "generation_seconds": 25.17352145491168, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0246-s005", "text": "På skattedeklarationen måste också pensioner från utlandet uppges.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0246-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.3138427734375, "generation_seconds": 21.477270774776116, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:24:27.339642+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0247-s001", "text": "Om en pensionär flyttar utomlands, måste hen alltid anmäla det till F P A.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0247-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.351959228515625, "generation_seconds": 23.458790350006893, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:25:00.929966+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0247-s002", "text": "Finska pensioner kan på vissa villkor fås till utlandet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0247-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.223419189453125, "generation_seconds": 17.594612282002345, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0247-s003", "text": "Det är bra att i förväg ta reda på om villkoren uppfylls.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0247-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.2720947265625, "generation_seconds": 17.69962972193025, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:25:34.518457+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0247-s004", "text": "Likaså kan en person i vissa fall ansöka om pension i Finland när hen går i pension i ett annat land.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0247-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.310089111328125, "generation_seconds": 29.30514078401029, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:26:08.102430+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0248-s001", "text": "En person kan arbeta även om hen är pensionerad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0248-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.318939208984375, "generation_seconds": 14.743133798008785, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0248-s002", "text": "Arbete som utförs när man är pensionär ökar arbetspensionens belopp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0248-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.49200439453125, "generation_seconds": 18.769102889113128, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:26:38.103426+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0248-s003", "text": "Som pensionär kan man arbeta deltid eller heltid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0248-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.3206787109375, "generation_seconds": 15.883605489972979, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:27:11.691253+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0248-s004", "text": "Om en person har invalidpension får hen arbeta endast i begränsad utsträckning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0248-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.30584716796875, "generation_seconds": 19.6955650979653, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T08:27:45.276340+00:00 hb-c10-pension tts: PID 248595 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0248-s005", "text": "Om arbetsinkomsterna överskrider en viss inkomstgräns kan utbetalningen av invalidpensionen avbrytas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-pension/narration/hb-c10-u0248-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.301971435546875, "generation_seconds": 30.83000916801393, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
